### CommerceFlow API Collection (REST Client / IntelliJ / VS Code)
### Base URL through Gateway: http://localhost:8080

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@example.com
@adminPassword = Admin-Secret-Pass-123!
@customerEmail = test-customer@example.com
@customerPassword = Customer-Secret-Pass-123!

### ========================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ========================================================

### Gateway Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Gateway Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### ========================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION SERVICE
### ========================================================

### Register Customer
# @name registerCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{customerPassword}}"
}

### Login Customer
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{customerPassword}}"
}

### Store Customer Access Token
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store Admin Access Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Get Current User Profile (NEW /api/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ========================================================
### 3. PRODUCT CATALOG SERVICE
### ========================================================

### List Products (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=0&size=20&sort=newest

### List Products by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=electronics

### Create Product (Admin Only)
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-AIR-001",
  "name": "Wireless Ergonomic Split Keyboard",
  "description": "Bluetooth 5.2, hot-swappable switches, low-latency mechanical keys",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 129.99
}

### Store Created Product ID
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### Update Product (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-AIR-001",
  "name": "Wireless Ergonomic Split Keyboard Pro",
  "description": "Bluetooth 5.2 + 2.4GHz wireless, hot-swappable tactile switches",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 149.99
}

### Delete / Soft Delete Product (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ========================================================
### 4. INVENTORY SERVICE
### ========================================================

### Get Product Stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Restock Product (Admin Only, Idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/{{productId}}/restock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 25
}

### ========================================================
### 5. ELASTICSEARCH SEARCH SERVICE
### ========================================================

### Full-Text Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=mechanical&page=0&size=10

### Filtered Search by Category and Price Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?category=electronics&minPrice=50&maxPrice=200

### ========================================================
### 6. SHOPPING CART (REDIS-BACKED)
### ========================================================

### Get Current User Cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Add Item to Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update Cart Item Quantity
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### Checkout from Cart (Triggers Saga & Empties Cart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMode": "SUCCESS"
}

### Remove Item from Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Clear Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ========================================================
### 7. ORDER SERVICE & DISTRIBUTED SAGA
### ========================================================

### Place Order - Mode: SUCCESS (Happy Path)
# @name createOrderSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "paymentMode": "SUCCESS"
}

### Store Created Order ID
@orderId = {{createOrderSuccess.response.body.id}}

### Check Order State (Poll until CONFIRMED or CANCELLED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Place Order - Mode: DECLINE (Tests Saga Compensation / Inventory Release)
# @name createOrderDecline
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "paymentMode": "DECLINE"
}

### List Customer Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### List All Orders (Admin View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/admin?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter All Orders by State (Admin View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/admin?state=CONFIRMED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ========================================================
### 7. PAYMENT SERVICE
### ========================================================

### Get Payment Status for Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ========================================================
### 8. NOTIFICATION SERVICE
### ========================================================

### Get Customer Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
